flowchart TD
    A([Scheduled reconciliation starts])
    --> B[Find configurations with pending changes]
    --> C{Pending configuration exists?}

    C -- No --> D([Finish])

    C -- Yes --> E[Select pending configuration]
    --> F[Set Processing]
    --> G[Apply latest configuration]
    --> H{Success?}

    H -- Yes --> I[Set Completed]
    H -- No --> J[Set Failed]

    I --> K{More pending configurations?}
    J --> K

    K -- Yes --> E
    K -- No --> D
